          "description": "A boy just misses his train, putting a highly anticipated trip at risk. A grandpa gets distracted while making pancakes, bringing a fire truck racing to the scene. A snow plow gets stuck while clearing the way for a mom about to have a baby. This collection of interactive short stories, fun facts, and a sing-along song is perfect for kids who love trucks, planes, and trains. From garbage trucks to tow trucks, these stories bring vehicles, trains, and airplanes to life. They also help children build resilience, patience, and empathy as they navigate their world. \n\nTender Tales are inclusive stories that value all children and families 🏳️‍🌈.\n\n",
